我脑袋还在脖子上
my head's still attached.

38
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:53,290
-你不用杀了他  -死的不是他就是那孩子
- You didn't have to kill him. - Eh, it was him or the kid.

39
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:55,820
他们应该能阻止他的
They could've stopped him.

40
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:58,110
不能冒险  尤其是现在
Couldn't take the chance, especially now.

41
00:01:58,110 --> 00:01:59,510
"尤其是现在"什么意思
What do you mean, "Especially now"?

42
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:01,090
我们拿到答案了
We got our answer.

43
00:02:02,580 --> 00:02:04,670
他们一直想要杀的就是他
He's what they've been after all along.

44
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:06,130
是啊  我们早就知道
Yeah, well, we knew that.

45
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:10,700
我们不知道铁拳是手和会所寻之物的关键[钥匙]We didn't know the Iron Fist was the key to what the Hand seeks.

46
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:12,810
这个词不是偶然
The word isn't accidental.

47
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:15,310
你觉得他是关键  他们存活的关键吗
You think he's a key? To what, their survival?

48
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:17,690
钥匙就说明有锁
A key implies a lock.

49
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:20,780
-我觉得这是隐喻  -不是的
- I assumed it was a metaphor. - It's not.

50
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:23,450
你真觉得丹尼能打开什么东西
So you literally think Danny opens something?

51
00:02:24,220 --> 00:02:28,260
而且那东西是值得献出生命的
And that something is worth dying for.

52
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:32,030
我是武器  不是钥匙
I'm a weapon. I'm not a key.

53
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:35,220
-不是你所知范围内的钥匙  -我能打开什么
- That you know of. - What could I possibly open?

54
00:02:35,470 --> 00:02:38,610
你说呢  所以他们才还没杀掉你
You tell me. Must be why they haven't killed you.

55
00:02:38,610 --> 00:02:41,070
他们没杀我是因为想让我跟他们同流合污
They haven't killed me because they want me on their side.

56
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:44,370
铁拳的气是一件武器  千真万确
The Iron Fist's chi is a weapon. That's true.

57
00:02:44,390 --> 00:02:47,620
但我听说  气还有其他用途
But I've heard stories about it being used for more.

58
00:02:47,630 --> 00:02:50,800
封存东西  或者再打开
To seal things shut. Or opening them again.

59
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:54,420
手和会来纽约是因为他给了他们通道
So the Hand is in New York because he gives them access

60
00:02:54,420 --> 00:02:56,420
或者打开了什么东西
or opens something up?

61
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:57,640
拜托  伙计们
Come on, guys.

62
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,280
这不可能
That's insane.

63
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:02,270
你觉得是真是假并不重要
Well, it doesn't matter if you think it's true or not.

64
00:03:02,270 --> 00:03:03,910
他们觉得是真的
It's something they believe is true.

65
00:03:04,350 --> 00:03:05,790
他曾是手和会的一员
He was a member of the Hand.

66
00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:09,240
那是一个充满了撒谎的变态们的组织
An organization formed by lying psychopaths.

67
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,820
他说的话你们一个字都不能信
You can't trust a word he said.

68
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:12,190
我懂  丹尼
I understand that, Danny,

69
00:03:12,670 --> 00:03:14,920
但我觉得  我们只有一个办法了
but the way I see it, we only have one move.

70
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,030
什么意思
What do you mean?

71
00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:24,880
让铁拳尽可能远离他们
To keep the Iron Fist as far from them as possible.

72
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:27,410
听起来是很疯狂  但我们没有其他办法了
It sounds crazy, but I don't think we have any other way.

73
00:03:28,450 --> 00:03:31,770
我为战斗献出过生命  你们需要我
I dedicated my life to this fight. You need me.

74
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:34,130
我们都需要彼此
We all need each other.

75
00:03:36,410 --> 00:03:38,240
这样他们就得逞了
This is exactly how they work.

76
00:03:38,730 --> 00:03:42,080
他们分裂我们  左右我们的思想  削弱我们
They divide us. They get into our heads. They weaken us.

77
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,650
他们让你们质疑信赖的人
They make you question the people you trust.

78
00:03:43,650 --> 00:03:46,700
丹尼  深呼吸  冷静一下
Danny, just take a deep breath and calm down.

79
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:50,980
别让我冷静  卢克  他们就想这样
Stop telling me to calm down, Luke! This is what they want!

80
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:54,390
他们想让你们分心  想让你们翻脸攻击我
They want you to be distracted. They want you to turn on me.

81
00:03:54,390 --> 00:03:55,810
索旺达没撒谎
Sowande wasn't lying.

82
00:03:56,290 --> 00:03:57,540
你怎么知道
And how do you know?

83
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:59,380
他的心跳没变  一下都没变
His heartbeat didn't waver. Not for a second.

84
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:01,450
他从背后突袭我的时候心跳又怎么样呢
And where was his heartbeat when he came up behind me?

85
00:04:03,070 --> 00:04:05,810
是手和会  你知道他们能控制人
It's the Hand. You know how they can operate.

86
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:08,920
现在我们知道他们要什么了  他们要你  小子
And now we know what they need. It's you, kid.

87
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:11,720
棍叟  你要掉进他们的陷阱里了
Stick, you're falling for their trap.

88
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:15,180
要是亚历山德拉控制了你  这场战争就输了
If Alexandra gets a hold of you, the war's lost.

89
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:17,960
我不允许那种事发生
I can't allow that.

90
00:04:18,530 --> 00:04:20,320
听着  棍叟  也许我们应该
Listen, Stick, maybe we should just...

91
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:23,220
让他保持低调  或者
let him lay low, or just...

92
00:04:23,260 --> 00:04:24,170
我们应该把他藏起来
Maybe we should just hide him.

93
00:04:24,170 --> 00:04:25,680
我们没时间了
We're running out of time!

94
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,490
他们在猎杀我们的朋友  家人
They're hunting our friends, our families,

95
00:04:28,490 --> 00:04:30,050
而且他们不会就此罢休
and they're not gonna stop there.

96
00:04:30,260 --> 00:04:34,300
你们听见他说的了  纽约将会变成废墟
You heard what he said. This ends with New York in ruins.

97
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:37,280
他们不想让我参与
They want me on the sidelines

98
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,180
因为只有我能摧毁他们
'cause I'm the only one who can destroy them.

99
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,640
杰西
Jess?

100
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,380
我们怎么藏他
How do you suggest we hide him?

101
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,090
好吧
Fine.

102
00:04:57,330 --> 00:04:59,530
要是非得这样  我就回去单干
I'll go back to doing this without you if I have to.

103
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:04,200
我已经失去一座城了  不想再失去一座
I've already lost one city. I'm not losing another.

104
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:06,370
我也不想
Me neither.

105
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:08,840
真的吗
Really?

106
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:12,430
你要强行把我留在这
You're gonna try and keep me here against my will?

107
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:14,420
我听见你说的了  丹尼  但是
I hear what you're saying, Danny, but...

108
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:16,130
没人比我更热爱这座城市
And no one loves this city more than I do,

109
00:05:16,130 --> 00:05:17,450
但你不能出这个房间
but you can't leave this room.

110
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:20,970
随便了
Whatever.

111
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:27,770
你真想这么做
You sure you want to do this?

112
00:05:27,770 --> 00:05:31,000
我不想  但如果必须的话我会的
No, I don't want to, but if I have to.

113
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:32,630
就像你隐藏你女朋友的秘密一样
Same way you had to keep your girlfriend secret?

114
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,700
-这事不是过去了吗  -没有
- We're past that. - No, we're not.

115
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:35,210
丹尼  我们都是一条战线上的
Danny, we're all on the same side here.

116
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:36,310
感觉可不是
It doesn't feel like it.

117
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:40,230
-不再是了  -别这么干
- Not anymore. - Don't do this.

118
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:45,860
你们退后  我是认真的
You guys seriously need to back off.

119
00:05:46,610 --> 00:05:49,300
你待在这  我们保护你安全  好吗
You just stay here. We can keep you safe, all right?

120
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:50,530
你只需要冷静下来
You just need to calm down.

121
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:52,470
这就是问题所在  马特
Well, that's the problem, Matt.

122
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,990
我没法冷静
I'm all out of calm.

123
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,320
够了
Enough.

124
00:06:49,870 --> 00:06:51,240
别逼我用这个
Don't make me use this.

125
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:30,320
对不住了
Sorry about this.

126
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:55,430
刚出狱  这是个消磨时间的好办法
Nice way to spend your time fresh out of prison.

127
00:08:56,570 --> 00:08:57,630
是啊
Yeah.

128
00:08:57,630 --> 00:09:00,050
真不敢相信要费这么大力气才能再次和你说上话
I can't believe this is what it took for us to talk again.

129
00:09:01,130 --> 00:09:04,710
我不太擅长跟人保持联系  但你可以打电话的
I'm not good at keeping in touch. But you could've called.

130
00:09:07,810 --> 00:09:08,930
好吧
Fair enough.

131
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:22,310
你觉得这样能绑住他
You think that'll hold?

132
00:09:22,460 --> 00:09:23,940
这是蟒蛇结
Well, it's a constrictor knot.

133
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:25,880
他越挣扎就系得越紧
Harder he pulls, harder it cinches.

134
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,430
你们不用担心绳子
Rope's not your concern.

135
00:09:27,470 --> 00:09:28,940
要担心的是他的铁拳
I'm gonna assume it's his Fist.

136
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,650
他一发招  什么都阻挡不了
When he summons it, shit goes sideways.

137
00:09:31,650 --> 00:09:32,890
我们有多长时间
How long do we have?

138
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:36,310
难说  一个小时吧
Hard to say. Eh, maybe an hour.

139
00:09:36,310 --> 00:09:38,450
我们得弄清楚他是什么的钥匙
And we need to figure out what he's the key to.

140
00:09:38,450 --> 00:09:40,430
他们的总部在中城圈
Their headquarters is Midland Circle.

141
00:09:40,430 --> 00:09:41,590
是啊  我们知道了
Yeah, we knew that.

142
00:09:41,710 --> 00:09:44,160
马特  你回去过吗
Matty, you ever go back to that place?

143
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:46,490
回去  怎么  你之前去过吗
Go back? What, have you been there before?

144
00:09:46,490 --> 00:09:49,790
去过  去年我调查手和会的时候
Yeah. Um, last year, when I was investigating the Hand,

145
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:51,940
我跟着线索到了一处建筑工地
the, uh, trail led me to a construction site,

146
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:53,590
现在那里是中城圈了
which is now Midland Circle.

147
00:09:53,590 --> 00:09:56,510
那里有个大洞  数百英尺深
Uh, there was a hole there. Hundreds of feet deep.

148
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,570
就在纽约中央
In the middle of New York?

149
00:09:57,570 --> 00:10:00,490
-是啊  -你这才想起来说吗
- Yeah. - And you're just now remembering this?

150
00:10:00,490 --> 00:10:02,860
你感觉到那洞底有什么吗
You sense anything at the bottom of that hole?

151
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:05,700
我觉得没有  我一直有留意
I don't think so. I kept tabs on it.

152
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:08,390
大楼完成后  我也感应不到洞了
Once the building was finished, my sense was the hole was gone.

153
00:10:08,390 --> 00:10:10,450
-你确定  -我对什么事都不能确定了
- You sure? - I'm not sure of anything anymore.

154
00:10:10,450 --> 00:10:11,670
你还没回答她
You didn't answer her question.

155
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:13,030
怎么才把这事告诉我
How come we are now just hearing about this?

156
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:14,970
-并不重要  卢克  -再说一次
- It wasn't important, Luke. - Try again.

157
00:10:14,970 --> 00:10:16,970
怎么了  不是  我们要操心的事够多了
What? No. We had enough to worry about.

158
00:10:16,970 --> 00:10:18,480
你有什么瞒着我们
What aren't you telling us?

159
00:10:21,990 --> 00:10:23,360
我当时跟艾丽卡在一起
I was with Elektra.

160
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:28,150
没把她的事告诉你们是个错误  我知道
It was a mistake not telling you guys about her. I realize that...

161
00:10:28,150 --> 00:10:30,220
你下次再刚巧
The next time you conveniently

162
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:32,360
忘记了会影响我们其他人的事
forget shit that affects the rest of us...

163
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,170
你也没那么坦诚  杰西卡
You're not exactly an open book yourself, Jessica.

164
00:10:34,170 --> 00:10:34,680
那是什么意思
What is that supposed to mean?

165
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,240
没人在挖掘你的过去
Well, no one's digging into your past.

166
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:38,680
我的过去不关你的事
My past is none of your goddamn business,

167
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,690
而且也没在努力想杀我们
and it's not actively trying to kill us.

168
00:10:40,690 --> 00:10:42,620
-时间不多了  -如果我们想要更多答案
- Clock is ticking. - So if we need more answers,

169
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:44,450
回中城圈是唯一的办法
going back to Midland Circle is the only play.

170
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:45,880
我们上次都勉强逃出来
We barely made it out last time,

171
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:47,280
他们肯定会有所准备的
and they're gonna be waiting for us.

172
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:50,820
-她说得对  -那我们怎么找到他能打开的东西
- Yeah, she's right. - So how do we find whatever he opens?

173
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:52,920
建筑师
The architect?

174
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:56,990
我客户的丈夫  你女朋友想杀的那个
My client's husband. The one your girlfriend tried to kill.

175
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,350
他设计了那里
He designed the place.

176
00:10:59,350 --> 00:11:01,400
你觉得他知道丹尼跟这一切的联系
What, you think he knows how Danny ties into this?

177
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,690
值得一试
It's worth a shot.

178
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:05,380
那你俩快去吧
Well, I guess you two better get going.

179
00:11:06,620 --> 00:11:07,740
你呢
What about you?

180
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,720
得有人留下看着他
Somebody's gotta stay and watch him.

181
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:15,040
最好是能经得住拳头的
Preferably somebody who can take a punch.

182
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:41,740
我知道你醒着
I know you're awake.

183
00:11:45,690 --> 00:11:48,700
是啊
Yes, I am.

184
00:11:51,070 --> 00:11:52,830
你睡了好几个小时了
You've been sleeping for hours.

185
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,390
谢谢
Thank you.

186
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:13,350
我喜欢这里
I like it here.

187
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,190
回纽约来
Back in New York?

188
00:12:17,250 --> 00:12:18,320
不
No.

189
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,570
回到你身边
Back with you.

190
