193
00:13:33,470 --> 00:13:36,920
追踪这些混蛋这么多年
You know, after years of tracking these assholes,

194
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:39,070
听说他们干的各种混蛋事
you hear about all the shit they've done.

195
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:42,680
就算你干掉了他们  他们死了
And even after you take 'em off the count and they're dead...

196
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:45,770
晚上依然夜不能寐
it's still enough to keep you up at night.

197
00:13:47,230 --> 00:13:49,160
这混蛋你在哪找到的
Where'd you find this piece of shit?

198
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,970
151街和阿姆斯特丹街的仓库
Warehouse on 151st and Amsterdam.

199
00:13:52,490 --> 00:13:54,110
他在哈莱姆招募孩子
He was hiring kids out of Harlem.

200
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:56,350
利用他们做清理队
Using them as a cleanup crew.

201
00:13:56,710 --> 00:13:59,320
销毁唐人街一家仓库里的尸体
Destroying bodies at an abandoned warehouse in Chinatown.

202
00:13:59,420 --> 00:14:03,420
我们的总部  那些尸体是我们最后的成员
Our headquarters. Those bodies were the last of us.

203
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:08,800
看着那孩子  我来处理这个
Watch the kid. I'll take care of this.

204
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:10,450
你什么意思
What do you mean, take care of it?

205
00:14:10,590 --> 00:14:13,840
不管这是不是跟手和会有关  这都是凶杀
I mean, Hand-related or not, that was a homicide, man.

206
00:14:15,210 --> 00:14:18,420
你又说对了  你知道得越少越好
You are right again. Less you know, the better.

207
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:21,590
你要干什么  处理掉尸体吗
What are you gonna do, get rid of the body?

208
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:24,590
是啊  差不多吧
Yeah. Something like that.

209
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,380
没错
Yeah, you're right.

210
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,970
我知道的越少越好
Less I know, the better.

211
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,880
你要不要告诉我一个无偿案律师
So you wanna tell me how a pro bono lawyer

212
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:39,170
怎么能在纽约住得起这样的阁楼
can afford a loft like this in New York City?

213
00:14:39,170 --> 00:14:40,150
你现在看不出
You can't tell now,

214
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:42,540
但街对面有块大霓虹灯广告牌
but there's a neon billboard across the street.

215
00:14:43,330 --> 00:14:44,950
大部分人晚上会睡不着
Keeps most people up at night...

216
00:14:45,750 --> 00:14:46,890
但我不会
not me.

217
00:14:47,860 --> 00:14:48,970
懂了
Got it.

218
00:14:49,900 --> 00:14:52,300
而且  我偶尔会帮助房东
Plus, I occasionally help the landlord out.

219
00:14:53,470 --> 00:14:56,480
虽然我不引以为豪  但我会穿上紧身衣
Not proud of it, but I put on the suit

220
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,660
去收拾那些迟交租金的人
and rough up people late on rent.

221
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,730
希望你是开玩笑
I hope that's a joke.

222
00:15:03,860 --> 00:15:05,030
抱歉这么乱
Sorry about the mess.

223
00:15:06,990 --> 00:15:08,950
没事  我家才叫乱呢
It's all right. You should see my place.

224
00:15:09,910 --> 00:15:11,280
你在家工作吗
What, do you work from home?

225
00:15:11,290 --> 00:15:13,890
我以前有个合伙人  我们有间办公室
I used to have a partner. We had an office.

226
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:16,000
后来呢
And?

227
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:17,940
现在没了
Now we don't.

228
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,130
准备好了吗
You ready?

229
00:15:21,070 --> 00:15:22,170
嗯
Yeah.

230
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:33,520
一切都好吗
Everything okay?

231
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:37,470
嗯  没事
Yeah. Uh, yeah.

232
00:15:40,910 --> 00:15:41,970
走吧
Let's go.

233
00:15:53,850 --> 00:15:58,490
一个特工在索旺达的一间仓库里发现了这个
An operative discovered this at one of Sowande's warehouses.

234
00:15:59,070 --> 00:16:02,510
无疑是我们的老朋友棍叟送去的
Delivered, no doubt, by our old friend Stick.

235
00:16:03,890 --> 00:16:07,670
索旺达自我们离开昆仑就一直跟我们在一起
Sowande has been with us since we departed K'un- Lun.

236
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:11,980
他的离去会震动组织上下
His loss will be felt throughout our entire organization.

237
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:15,530
已经发生了
It has happened.

238
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:19,300
死亡就是这个样子
This is what mortality looks like.

239
00:16:19,420 --> 00:16:23,360
-这是本可以避免的  -是他自己失手被擒
- A loss we could have prevented. - He got himself captured.

240
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:26,370
-我们根本没去找过他  -得了
- We didn't even try to find him. - Oh, please.

241
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:30,760
-我们就别假装为他的死难过了  -假装
- Let's not pretend to mourn this loss. - Pretend?

242
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:33,860
难道我们在一起的这些年一直和和睦睦吗
As if our time together has always been peaceful.

243
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:36,560
难道我们就没发生过分歧吗
As if there's never been any discord.

244
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:40,050
难道我们没有成功躲过这屋里
As if we haven't all survived assassination attempts

245
00:16:40,050 --> 00:16:42,810
站在我们对面的人派来的刺客吗
by those across from us in this very room.

246
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:59,620
现在  我们更该团结一致
Now, more than ever, it's time to show unity.

247
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:01,290
我们本来是团结的
We were unified.

248
00:17:01,670 --> 00:17:03,960
直到你把黑空带来
Until you brought the Black Sky into the fold.

249
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:05,700
她在哪
Where is she?

250
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:07,630
-她很安全  -那是什么意思
- She's safe. - What does that mean?

251
00:17:07,630 --> 00:17:09,640
我不觉得我没必要回答你
I don't think I have to answer to you.

252
00:17:09,990 --> 00:17:12,830
但鉴于这几小时内发生的事
But considering the events of the last few hours,

253
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:15,080
我觉得最好还是把她隔离起来
I thought it best to keep her isolated.

254
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:18,320
因为你怕我们杀了她
Because you think we will kill her?

255
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:19,500
不
No.

256
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:25,910
我觉得如果她感到了你的不忠  可能会杀了你
I think she might kill you if she even senses your disloyalty.

257
00:17:26,690 --> 00:17:28,970
我们无意不忠
We mean no disloyalty.

258
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:33,700
我们的目标是一致的  几世纪以来一直如此
Our goals are in alignment, as they have been for centuries.

259
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:37,180
我现在不太确定了
I am not so sure anymore.

260
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:41,330
我们必须为索旺达的牺牲坚持战斗
We must honor Sowande by continuing to fight for

261
00:17:41,330 --> 00:17:42,690
来纪念他失去的东西
what he lost.

262
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,340
生命本身
Life itself.

263
00:17:45,870 --> 00:17:48,120
我们的领袖已带我们走到了今天
Our leader has brought us this far.

264
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:51,380
我愿意继续追随她
And I for one will continue to follow her,

265
00:17:51,430 --> 00:17:54,380
直到我们抓到铁拳
until we have the Iron Fist.

266
00:17:54,410 --> 00:17:57,510
直到我们从纽约得到我们需要的东西
Until we get what we need from New York.

267
00:18:06,370 --> 00:18:07,490
我觉得是在前面
I think it's up here.

268
00:18:08,130 --> 00:18:09,560
-你觉得  -我不知道
- You think? - I don't know.

269
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:11,930
这些豪宅看上去都一个样  是吧
All these brownstones look the same, don't they?

270
00:18:12,670 --> 00:18:13,590
该死
Oh, shit.

271
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:14,780
抱歉  总忘记你是...
Sorry, I keep forgetting you're...

272
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:16,560
没事  经常的
Don't worry about it. Happens.

273
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:19,860
那么  我需要了解这个建筑师的什么情况
So, what do I need to know about the architect?

274
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:22,310
他妻子雇我找他
His wife hired me to find him.

275
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:23,760
他没跟她说多少
He didn't tell her much.

276
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:26,710
当然不会说什么纽约地下有秘密隧道
Especially not about some secret tunnel under New York.

277
00:18:26,710 --> 00:18:29,200
不是隧道  是个洞  直上直下的
Not a tunnel. It's a hole, straight down.

278
00:18:29,420 --> 00:18:32,360
是啊  他自己爆头之前
Right. Well, right before he shot himself,

279
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:34,310
他说"他们"要毁掉整座城市
he said "they" were going to take down the city.

280
00:18:34,310 --> 00:18:36,210
显然  我们知道"他们"是手和会
Obviously, we know now "they" are the Hand.

281
00:18:36,810 --> 00:18:39,680
-他也是一员吗  -他说他是好人
- Was he one of them? - He said he was one of the good guys.

282
00:18:40,490 --> 00:18:41,550
你相信他吗
And you believed him?

283
00:18:43,210 --> 00:18:45,320
我不会听心跳  但我会看人
I don't read heartbeats, but I do read people.

284
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:48,570
他都急疯了  开始囤积炸药
He was desperate. He started stockpiling explosives.

285
00:18:48,710 --> 00:18:50,750
你觉得他的目标是中城圈
And you think his target was Midland Circle?

286
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:55,310
或许吧  其实  好像就是这里了
Maybe. Actually, I think this is it.

287
00:18:55,690 --> 00:18:58,490
-好像  -99%确定
- You think? - Ninety-nine percent.

288
00:18:58,860 --> 00:19:01,210
92%吧  那也不少了
Ninety-two percent. But that's still a lot.

289
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,540
-莱克西  是吧  -我妈妈不在
- Lexi, right? - My mom isn't here.

290
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,850
你知道她什么时候能回来吗
You have any idea when she'll be back?

291
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:20,710
你想干什么
What do you want?

292
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:24,170
-就是聊聊  -又聊我爸爸吗
- Just to talk. - About my dad again?

293
00:19:24,190 --> 00:19:25,570
关于发生的事
About what happened.

294
00:19:26,090 --> 00:19:28,970
你自己说了  他卷入了黑帮还是什么的
You said so yourself. He got mixed up with the mob or something.

295
00:19:28,970 --> 00:19:31,420
-不是黑帮  -抱歉  你是谁
- Wasn't the mob. - Sorry. Who are you?

296
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:34,150
-他是个律师  -什么
- He's a lawyer. - A what?

297
00:19:34,150 --> 00:19:36,130
莱克西  我叫马修·默多克
Lexi, my name is Matthew Murdock.

298
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:38,060
我们认为你爸的事没那么简单
We think there's more to your dad's story.

299
00:19:38,660 --> 00:19:39,950
如果你能回答几个问题
If you could just answer a couple of questions,

300
00:19:39,950 --> 00:19:41,170
会帮我们大忙
it'd be a tremendous help.

301
00:19:43,430 --> 00:19:44,490
好吧
Okay.

302
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:06,980
关着的门以前是有一定含义的
Closed door used to mean something.

303
00:20:07,700 --> 00:20:09,250
抱歉
My apologies.

304
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:13,640
我们认识那么久了
In all the time we've known each other,

305
00:20:14,170 --> 00:20:16,290
我从未见过你这样
I've never seen you like this.

306
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:26,720
你的位置拥有很大权力
Your position is one of great power.

307
00:20:27,430 --> 00:20:30,480
但这即是福气也是负担
But it is a burden as much as a blessing.

308
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:34,840
所以我说服了其他人追随你
Which is why I've convinced the others to follow your lead.

309
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:41,050
你和我一直能理解彼此
You and I have always understood each other.

310
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:43,110
有一个条件
Under a single condition.

311
00:20:43,380 --> 00:20:46,770
我们要自己去找到并抓到铁拳
We will seek out and capture the Iron Fist ourselves

312
00:20:46,770 --> 00:20:48,250
不用黑空
without the Black Sky.

313
00:20:48,250 --> 00:20:51,550
这么没有信心不像你
It's not like you to show such a lack of faith.

314
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:55,050
亚历山德拉  你一般也不会如此...
And it's not like you, Alexandra, to show such...

315
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:58,740
软弱吗
Weakness?

316
00:21:00,180 --> 00:21:05,490
我们的兄弟们  虽然不会说话  但说的是事实
Our brothers, while clumsy in delivery, speak the truth.

317
00:21:05,890 --> 00:21:09,930
黑空一直是你的预言  你的愿景
The Black Sky has always been your prophecy, your vision.

318
00:21:10,890 --> 00:21:13,160
-而你失败了  -我不同意
- And you have failed. - I don't agree.

319
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:17,270
她对我们的成功很重要  你得跟他们谈谈
She is essential to our success. You must talk to them.

320
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:18,690
我试过了
I've tried.

321
00:21:18,980 --> 00:21:22,900
她复活之后  我们并未更接近抓到铁拳
Ever since her resurrection, we are no closer to the Iron Fist,

322
00:21:22,900 --> 00:21:25,810
找到圣物  或回归昆仑
or the substance, or returning to K'un- Lun.

323
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:29,200
我们只是离死亡更近了
The only thing we're closer to is death.

324
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:31,030
你怎么看不到我看到的
How can you not see what I see?

325
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:32,490
她是很厉害
Oh, she is skilled, yes...

326
00:21:32,490 --> 00:21:35,010
我不是在说她的能力
I'm not talking about her abilities.

327
00:21:35,850 --> 00:21:39,380
她拥有的力量  只有你我能想象
She has a strength that you and I can only imagine.

328
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:45,320
就算是  其他人不这么认为
Even if I did, the others do not feel the same way.

329
00:21:45,390 --> 00:21:47,860
其他人想要我的位置
The others want my seat at the table.

330
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:52,120
如你所说  这以前也发生过  我也经历了
As you said, it has happened before. I was there.

331
00:21:52,970 --> 00:21:55,950
高  当初就是你带头的
Gao, you were the one who led it.

332
00:21:58,250 --> 00:21:59,940
过去都过去了
Past is the past.

333
00:22:00,870 --> 00:22:03,960
现在  我可能是你唯一的同盟
Right now, I may be your only ally.

334
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:07,860
你不相信黑空足以拯救我们
And you don't believe the Black Sky is enough to save us?

335
00:22:07,860 --> 00:22:10,870
我已经知道不该相信任何东西
I have learned not to believe in anything.

336
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:14,250
但我们在一起的日子还没结束
But our time together is not over.

337
00:22:14,780 --> 00:22:15,970
现在还没
Not yet.

338
00:22:16,990 --> 00:22:19,040
考虑下我的提议吧
Consider my proposal.

339
00:22:20,470 --> 00:22:23,940
我们今晚就可以准备行动
We could be ready to move tonight.

340
00:22:32,350 --> 00:22:33,530
你是对的
You were right.

341
00:23:06,060 --> 00:23:08,620
你挣开之后  我就在这里
I'll be right here when you're done.

342
00:23:12,490 --> 00:23:14,000
你把我像个囚犯一样捆着
You've got me tied up like a prisoner.

343
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:18,830
不是"像"  你就是个囚犯
Not "like." You're definitely a prisoner.

344
00:23:19,810 --> 00:23:21,130
看上去并不好
It's not a good look.

345
00:23:22,780 --> 00:23:25,800
马特呢  杰西卡呢
Where's Matt? Where's Jessica?

346
00:23:25,890 --> 00:23:28,200
他们去挖掘中城圈的情报了
They're digging up info on Midland Circle.

347
00:23:28,370 --> 00:23:30,290
我们认为一切都是从那里开始
We think that's where it all started.

348
00:23:30,340 --> 00:23:34,290
"我们"  你们几个都要一起对付我吗
"We"? As in the rest of you who worked against me?

349
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,330
听着
Look.

350
00:23:38,580 --> 00:23:39,990
如果你肯听我们的  而不是跟我们打
If you'd listened instead of fighting us,

351
00:23:39,990 --> 00:23:41,780
你就也能参与我们的讨论了
you would've been around for the conversation.

352
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:43,410
而且我觉得你也会认同的
And I think you would've agreed.

353
00:23:44,800 --> 00:23:47,710
中城圈有蹊跷  尤其现在我们知道了那个洞
Midland Circle's suspect. Especially now that we found the hole.

354
00:23:47,710 --> 00:23:48,880
什么洞
What hole?

355
00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:52,630
默多克觉得中城圈有点不对劲
Murdock thinks there's something weird about Midland Circle.

356
00:23:56,130 --> 00:23:57,980
他们让你看住我
And they got you on guard duty.

357
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:59,540
那得看你了
Nah, that depends on you.

358
00:24:01,050 --> 00:24:02,200
大错误
Big mistake.

359
00:24:09,570 --> 00:24:10,970
你看不懂情况吗
Don't you see what's happening?

360
00:24:12,270 --> 00:24:14,200
你把我捆了起来  就好像我是敌人
You've got me tied up like I'm the enemy,

361
00:24:14,530 --> 00:24:17,030
而他们在外面  想杀死我们在乎的人
and they're out there trying to kill the people we care about.

362
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:19,380
-米丝蒂在保护大家  -暂时的
- Misty's keeping everyone safe. - For now.

363
00:24:19,380 --> 00:24:20,550
但我所在乎的人
But I care about a lot more people

364
00:24:20,550 --> 00:24:22,410
一个警察局里放不下
than we can fit in a police station.

365
00:24:23,330 --> 00:24:24,740
我知道你也一样
And I know you do, too.

366
00:24:26,070 --> 00:24:27,880
城市有危险
This city is at stake.

367
00:24:29,420 --> 00:24:30,520
我和你
Me and you...

368
00:24:31,590 --> 00:24:33,460
卢克·凯奇和铁拳
Luke Cage and the Iron Fist...

369
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,460
我们该出去战斗
we belong out there.

370
