Closest I ever had to family.

553
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,630
除了马特
Aside from Matty.

554
00:37:07,380 --> 00:37:08,900
和艾丽卡之外
And Elektra.

555
00:37:09,060 --> 00:37:12,080
-节哀顺变  -谢谢
- Sorry for your loss. - Thanks.

556
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:14,990
这和我们接下来要做的事相比不算什么
It's nothin' compared to what comes next.

557
00:37:16,770 --> 00:37:18,330
这香是用来干什么的
What's with the incense?

558
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:22,390
能帮助我冥想
Helps me meditate.

559
00:37:24,180 --> 00:37:25,930
寻求指引
Ask for guidance.

560
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:29,030
宽恕  之类的东西
Forgiveness. That kinda thing.

561
00:37:37,520 --> 00:37:40,540
那个建筑师发现自己的大楼下还有一个建筑结构
So the architect discovers a structure underneath his building.

562
00:37:40,540 --> 00:37:41,910
不管那是什么  他都宁死
And whatever it is, it's bad enough

563
00:37:41,910 --> 00:37:43,610
也要炸掉那个东西
that he dies trying to blow it up.

564
00:37:44,070 --> 00:37:45,280
没错  他想摧毁掉
Right, he wanted to destroy it.

565
00:37:45,290 --> 00:37:46,460
但他不想炸掉
But he didn't want to blow it up.

566
00:37:46,460 --> 00:37:48,300
我觉得他是想压倒那个结构
I think he wanted to collapse it down.

567
00:37:48,950 --> 00:37:50,550
你确定那个洞里的结构是人造的吗
Are you sure the structure in the hole is man-made?

568
00:37:50,550 --> 00:37:52,120
会不会是什么基岩
Could it be some sort of bedrock?

569
00:37:52,170 --> 00:37:54,440
三十层楼深  还有完美的圆顶
Thirty stories deep, in a perfect dome?

570
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:56,230
好吧  有道理
All right. Fair enough.

571
00:37:58,290 --> 00:37:59,460
杰西卡
Jessica?

572
00:38:00,700 --> 00:38:01,840
你怎么知道的
How'd you know?

573
00:38:02,690 --> 00:38:03,910
知道什么
About what?

574
00:38:05,180 --> 00:38:06,500
我爸爸的事
About my dad.

575
00:38:07,770 --> 00:38:09,390
格斗瞎眼律师
A crime-fighting blind lawyer,

576
00:38:09,390 --> 00:38:11,460
我猜背后的故事肯定很精彩
I figured there had gotta be a good story there.

577
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:13,730
或者很糟心
Or a shitty one.

578
00:38:14,930 --> 00:38:16,730
你接手了我的案子  我也赠与回礼
You took my case, I took yours.

579
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:20,830
我只是觉得如果我们相互信任
I just think we'll work better together

580
00:38:20,830 --> 00:38:23,170
会合作的更好  你觉得呢
if we trust each other. Don't you?

581
00:38:23,560 --> 00:38:25,600
这是你对我说过态度最好的话
That is the nicest thing you've ever said to me.

582
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:27,040
可别习惯这种语气了
Yeah, don't get used to it.

583
00:38:29,460 --> 00:38:30,990
这么多烟
So much smoke.

584
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,910
这是什么东西
What is this stuff?

585
00:38:36,100 --> 00:38:39,280
加点这个  加点那个
Eh, little of this, little of that.

586
00:38:44,100 --> 00:38:45,480
那孩子没说错
Kid was right.

587
00:38:46,430 --> 00:38:47,860
这是战争
This is war.

588
00:38:50,270 --> 00:38:52,080
他们需要他才能胜利
And they need him to win it.

589
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:56,830
假设我们只有两种选择
We assumed we only had two choices.

590
00:38:58,130 --> 00:39:00,400
逃跑或者引战
Run or fight.

591
00:39:03,820 --> 00:39:05,780
我找到了第三种
I found a third option.

592
00:39:11,860 --> 00:39:13,040
有点不对劲
Something's wrong.

593
00:39:16,220 --> 00:39:18,870
卢克  卢克
Luke! Luke!

594
00:39:31,940 --> 00:39:35,770
你不会感觉到任何痛苦的  孩子  我保证
You won't feel any pain, kid. I promise.

595
00:39:45,870 --> 00:39:47,400
你没必要这么做
You don't have to do this.

596
00:39:47,660 --> 00:39:51,510
亚历山德拉说我不知道你是什么  她没说错
Alexandra said I didn't know what you were. She was right.

597
00:39:51,590 --> 00:39:55,030
你是我们的武器  但他们将你据为己有
You were our weapon. But they made you theirs.

598
00:39:55,030 --> 00:39:56,220
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

599
00:39:56,220 --> 00:39:59,110
你一直全心全意为昆仑效力
You served K'un-Lun as well as you could.

600
00:39:59,220 --> 00:40:01,530
如果有幸  你会再次见到那里
With any luck, you'll see it again.

601
00:40:01,540 --> 00:40:03,700
我想那里肯定很美
I would imagine it's beautiful.

602
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:05,030
棍叟
Stick...

603
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:07,170
你得听我说
you need to listen to me.

604
00:40:14,990 --> 00:40:17,160
我也想有别的办法  孩子
I wish there was another way, kid.

605
00:40:17,160 --> 00:40:20,880
但这个世界上有很多东西比我要坏的多
But there are things in this world far worse than me.

606
00:40:20,880 --> 00:40:21,990
棍叟
Stick!

607
00:40:24,380 --> 00:40:25,720
你不能夺走她  孩子
You can't have him, girl.

608
00:40:25,720 --> 00:40:27,740
你没法再向我发号施令了
You no longer get to tell me what to do.

609
00:41:13,340 --> 00:41:14,490
艾丽卡
Elektra!

610
00:41:18,730 --> 00:41:21,200
-听我说  -马修
- Listen to me. - Matthew.

611
00:41:22,110 --> 00:41:24,760
你不需要这样做的  好吗
You don't have to do this. All right?

612
00:41:25,050 --> 00:41:28,240
你不属于他们  你不是那样的人
You don't belong to them. This is not who you are.

613
00:41:28,680 --> 00:41:30,000
见到你真好
It's good to see you.

614
00:41:35,380 --> 00:41:36,560
不
No!

615
00:42:55,300 --> 00:42:56,610
我能和你一起吗
May I join you?

616
00:42:57,760 --> 00:43:00,590
我知道你喜欢一个人用餐
You like to dine alone, I know.

617
00:43:00,790 --> 00:43:02,890
但我觉得我需要做出弥补
But I feel the need to make amends.

618
00:43:04,450 --> 00:43:06,000
我还以为那些酒
I thought that entire vintage

619
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:08,600
都在马赛大火中付之一炬了
had been destroyed in the fires at Marseille.

620
00:43:09,010 --> 00:43:11,650
巴利阿里群岛海底总能让你
You'd be surprised what you can find

621
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:14,090
发现不少惊喜
at the bottom of the Balearic Sea.

622
00:43:17,080 --> 00:43:18,230
继续说
Go on.

623
00:43:21,140 --> 00:43:23,260
我本来是不想和你一起离开昆仑的
I did not originally want to leave K'un-Lun with you.

624
00:43:23,440 --> 00:43:25,200
你还记得吗
Do you remember?

625
00:43:25,790 --> 00:43:29,620
我记得  你想和长老们一起
I do. You wanted to stay with the elders.

626
00:43:30,470 --> 00:43:31,970
你想
You wanted to...

627
00:43:33,140 --> 00:43:36,000
只用我们的发现做善事
use our discoveries only for good.

628
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:40,930
你该知道真相了
It's time for you to know the truth.

629
00:43:45,730 --> 00:43:49,460
我当时不想留在昆仑
I did not want to stay in K'un-Lun at the time.

630
00:43:50,060 --> 00:43:52,440
我只是不想和你一起走
I simply did not want to leave with you.

631
00:43:54,270 --> 00:43:56,190
这并不意外
Well, that's no surprise.

632
00:43:57,070 --> 00:44:00,410
你一直只关注你自己的力量
Your own strength was always your singular focus.

633
00:44:01,070 --> 00:44:03,240
所以我才活到现在
It's gotten me this far.

634
00:44:06,100 --> 00:44:08,560
我还在等你给我道歉
I'm still waiting for my apology.

635
00:44:12,880 --> 00:44:14,640
你应该和高聊过了
I assume you've spoken to Gao.

636
00:44:15,730 --> 00:44:16,850
是的
I have.

637
00:44:22,000 --> 00:44:24,320
不管之前发生了什么
Regardless of what has come before,

638
00:44:24,500 --> 00:44:27,650
这次我们都应该一起战斗
we were meant to fight this war together.

639
00:44:28,770 --> 00:44:31,830
当然了  所以...
Of course. Which is why...

640
00:44:33,620 --> 00:44:37,210
我希望你能好好享用这最后一顿饭
I wanted your last meal to be a good one.

641
00:44:43,030 --> 00:44:44,460
你一个人来...
You came alone...

642
00:44:45,300 --> 00:44:46,600
挑战我
to face me?

643
00:44:49,630 --> 00:44:50,850
愚蠢
Foolish.

644
00:44:52,140 --> 00:44:56,030
但你一直是...一头孤狼
But then you always were... A lone wolf.

645
00:44:57,260 --> 00:44:58,660
这个比喻很有意思
An interesting metaphor.

646
00:45:00,520 --> 00:45:02,800
但是如果你了解我
But if you knew me at all...

647
00:45:04,660 --> 00:45:05,960
你就会知道
you'd know...

648
00:45:07,930 --> 00:45:09,690
我是猎狼者
I hunt the wolf.

649
00:45:25,010 --> 00:45:26,820
如果你了解我
If you knew me at all,

650
00:45:27,280 --> 00:45:30,260
你就会知道  我永远会赢
you'd know I always win.

651
00:45:36,620 --> 00:45:38,400
在会议室
In the boardroom...

652
00:45:49,250 --> 00:45:52,340
兰德先生  我代表大家
Mr. Rand, I know I speak for all of us

653
00:45:52,340 --> 00:45:55,520
告诉你  我们很高兴又和你一起了
when I say how nice it is to have you with us again.

654
00:45:55,760 --> 00:45:57,200
这次  是永远一起了
This time, for good.

655
00:45:57,270 --> 00:45:58,450
这场战争
This war...

656
00:46:00,780 --> 00:46:02,180
没有结束
it isn't over.

657
00:46:03,190 --> 00:46:05,360
战争的关键是
Well, the thing about war is...

658
00:46:05,760 --> 00:46:09,800
只有两边都坚信自己是正确的才会发生
it only works if both sides believe they're the good guys.

659
00:46:10,270 --> 00:46:15,050
你要打倒我们  你要夺回曾是我们的东西
You fight to defeat us. We fight to get back what was once ours.

660
00:46:16,180 --> 00:46:17,800
你想要什么
And what is it that you want?

661
00:46:18,530 --> 00:46:20,170
回到昆仑
To return to K'un-Lun.

662
00:46:21,320 --> 00:46:23,990
那不可能  那里已经被你摧毁了
That's impossible. You destroyed it.

663
00:46:25,530 --> 00:46:26,710
我看到了
I saw.

664
00:46:27,180 --> 00:46:29,690
你看到了你想看到的东西
You saw what you wanted to see.

665
00:46:31,290 --> 00:46:35,960
事实上  我们俩没有什么区别
The truth is, you and I, we're not so different.

666
00:46:36,470 --> 00:46:38,230
我们拥有共同的家
We share the same home.

667
00:46:38,660 --> 00:46:41,610
我们都只想回到那里
We both want nothing more than to return to it.

668
00:46:41,910 --> 00:46:45,860
现在  没有了死亡的阻碍
And now, without death standing in our way,

669
00:46:46,160 --> 00:46:49,090
我相信我们能合作
I believe we can, together.

670
00:46:49,090 --> 00:46:50,260
不
No.

671
00:46:52,430 --> 00:46:54,130
我们不一样
We are not the same.

672
00:46:55,150 --> 00:46:56,310
我知道
I know.

673
00:46:57,410 --> 00:46:58,860
但是最终
But in the end...

674
00:47:00,690 --> 00:47:02,460
现在就是最终
and this is the end...

675
00:47:02,740 --> 00:47:05,210
你会像其他所有人为我做的一样
you'll do what everyone else does for me.

676
00:47:06,510 --> 00:47:07,940
你会效忠于我
You'll serve.

677
00:47:16,420 --> 00:47:17,750
你要带我去哪里
Where are you taking me?

678
00:47:20,220 --> 00:47:23,730
解决了他  我们可以继续我们的计划了
Well, now that he's taken care of, we can proceed as planned.

679
00:47:23,770 --> 00:47:26,440
计划进展得并不顺利
Little has gone as planned.

680
00:47:26,780 --> 00:47:32,260
我们是抓到了铁拳  但是代价呢
Yes, we have the Iron Fist, but at what cost?

681
00:47:32,310 --> 00:47:35,470
有什么代价能比我们的命更重要
Is any cost too great for our survival?

682
00:47:35,470 --> 00:47:37,470
如果是我们的命  那的确没错
When it's the life of one of ours, yes.

683
00:47:37,470 --> 00:47:39,530
我们必须放眼未来
We must look to the future.

684
00:47:39,670 --> 00:47:41,760
那是我们最重要的资产
It's our greatest asset.

685
00:47:41,770 --> 00:47:42,770
从现在开始
From this moment forth,

686
00:47:42,770 --> 00:47:45,400
我们唯一的重点就是保护圣物
our sole focus is to secure the substance.

687
00:47:45,400 --> 00:47:48,100
在他的盟友来找他之前
Before his allies come for him.

688
00:47:48,560 --> 00:47:50,410
我们不能小看他们
We cannot underestimate them.

689
00:47:50,410 --> 00:47:52,990
不要小看我
Do not underestimate me!

690
00:47:56,890 --> 00:47:58,500
杀了卢克·凯奇
Kill Luke Cage.

691
00:47:58,500 --> 00:48:00,120
杀了杰西卡·琼斯
Kill Jessica Jones.

692
00:48:00,120 --> 00:48:03,020
还有地狱厨房的恶魔  不管他是谁
And the Devil of Hell's Kitchen, whoever he is.

693
00:48:03,880 --> 00:48:06,780
很高兴你们都赞同实行计划
I'm so happy you're all on board with the plan.

694
00:48:06,920 --> 00:48:10,920
但是别忘了  是我消灭了我们的敌人
But let me remind you, I neutralized our enemies.

695
00:48:10,920 --> 00:48:13,220
是我抓来了铁拳
I brought you the Iron Fist.

696
00:48:13,320 --> 00:48:15,790
你们只会制造混乱和冲突
I was able to keep the most important operation

697
00:48:15,790 --> 00:48:16,730
是我得以确保
in our history running

698
00:48:16,730 --> 00:48:19,390
能继续实行我们最重要的计划
while you succumbed to chaos and conflict.

699
00:48:19,480 --> 00:48:23,770
我已经证明我是唯一真正的领导者
I have proven myself to be the one and only true leader--

700
00:48:31,730 --> 00:48:33,380
他的名字叫马修
His name is Matthew.

701
00:48:41,100 --> 00:48:42,640
我的名字
And my name...

702
00:48:43,130 --> 00:48:45,590
叫艾丽卡·纳齐丝
is Elektra Natchios.

703
00:48:46,970 --> 00:48:48,380
你们现在都效忠于我了
You work for me now.

704
00:49:06,000 --> 00:49:07,280
有问题吗
Any questions?

